WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.434
-Donald Trump arrived
in New York today

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:04.434
so that he could
be arraigned Tuesday

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:05.734
at the Manhattan
Criminal Courthouse

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.467
after a grand jury
voted to indict him,

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:09.400
making him the first
president in history

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.901
to face criminal charges.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.801
And his allies on Fox
have been desperately

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:16.000
trying to dismiss the charges
as insignificant and biased,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.901
while also claiming
they will make him a hero.

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:20.167
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:22.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:24.133
♪♪

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:26.400
Well, by the time
you're seeing this,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.400
Trump has almost
certainly arrived in New York

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.734
after being indicted.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.834
News networks were showing
live coverage of his plane

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.033
taking off from Mar-a-Lago

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.067
like it was the [bleep]
space shuttle.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:38.834
This is all still very surreal.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:41.901
I honestly never thought
I'd say the words,

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:43.267
"Donald Trump
has been indicted."

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:45.334
True story --
we've had that cue card ready

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:46.667
for seven years now.

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:48.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:51.300
It's so dusty,
I can barely read the words.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.133
-[ Blowing ]

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:55.901
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.534
-Thank you, Wally.

00:00:57.534 --> 00:01:01.267
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.501
But, you guys, for me, this is
an especially big moment

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:06.167
because for seven years now,
people have been coming up to me

00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:07.734
and telling me it's my fault

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.634
Donald Trump ran for president
because I made fun of him

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:11.868
at the 2011 White House
Correspondents Dinner.

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:16.467
And now today, I can finally
say my plan worked.

00:01:16.467 --> 00:01:18.434
Goad him into running
for president,

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:21.000
during which time he will most
certainly commit at least one,

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.367
if not several, crimes

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:24.400
he will eventually be
investigated and indicted for.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.601
Did I think it would be
for paying hush money

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:28.501
to a porn star?
I did.

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:32.300
Even kept the napkin
I wrote the plan on that night.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.834
So I guess the only question
now is, was it worth it?

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:39.033
Definitely not.
Long story short, I [bleep] up.

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.934
Now...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:44.000
I don't have to tell you,
this is earth-shattering news,

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.000
and it arrived at
an especially shocking moment.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.334
Last week, after everyone
assumed the grand jury

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.133
had basically paused its work.

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:51.434
It was about to take
a long break.

00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:52.734
The news was so shocking

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:55.200
that when Fox News
announced it on air,

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.334
if you listen closely,
there were audible gasps

00:01:58.334 --> 00:01:59.534
inside the studio.

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:00.934
-We have just gotten word...
-[ Gasps ]

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:04.067
-...former president
Donald Trump has been indicted.

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:07.167
-Fox News was so unprepared
for this moment,

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:10.634
their studio basically turned
into the set from a telenovela.

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:12.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.100
[ Gasps ]
Donald Trump has been indicted,

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:17.567
and he has an evil twin!

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:18.901
Ay, dios mío.

00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:20.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:23.367
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:24.434
[ Gasps ]

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:26.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:29.000
Now, of course, Donald Trump
could never have an evil twin

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.501
because he is the evil twin.

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:33.567
He would have a twin who,
like, teaches kindergarten

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:35.100
and then...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.868
...delivers meals
to shut-ins on the weekend.

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:40.033
"We love the shut-ins,
don't we, folks?

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:41.868
Many people say,
"Why don't they go outside?"

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.200
and I say,
"It's right there in the name.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.868
They're shut-in."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.868 --> 00:02:46.434
But they'll never be shut out

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:47.834
if we keep them
in our thoughts.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.901
And, look, I'm not saying
the news wasn't shocking.

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:53.133
It was. I walked off
my set last Thursday

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:56.334
after we taped our show,
saw the news alert on my phone,

00:02:56.334 --> 00:02:57.968
and thought it was
an early April Fool's prank

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.634
from my friend Andy Samberg.

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:10.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.834 --> 00:03:13.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.400
And not only was
the news itself shocking,

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.100
but the details
that started to come out

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:20.067
about the possible charges
were even more shocking.

00:03:20.067 --> 00:03:22.567
-Breaking news,
and it is historic.

00:03:22.567 --> 00:03:24.267
Former president Donald J. Trump

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:26.567
has been indicted
by a New York grand jury

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:29.834
investigating hush-money
payments to adult-film-star

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:31.133
Stormy Daniels.

00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:33.667
It is the first time
in American history

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:35.501
that a current
or former president

00:03:35.501 --> 00:03:37.400
is facing criminal charges.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.100
Learning from your reporting
that there's 34 counts

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.367
of falsification
of business documents.

00:03:41.367 --> 00:03:42.868
Do you understand
that there are more

00:03:42.868 --> 00:03:44.801
or possibly more --
different charges,

00:03:44.801 --> 00:03:46.901
or is that, as you understand,
the totality of it?

00:03:46.901 --> 00:03:50.467
-I believe that that is the
grand jury's work in this case.

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:53.100
Now, they could add
additional charges later

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.000
as other information comes up
with a superseding indictment.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.868
But let's go on the premise
that 34 counts of anything

00:03:59.868 --> 00:04:02.868
is a pretty complete
and thorough look at something.

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:04.434
-34 counts. That's insane.

00:04:04.434 --> 00:04:06.934
Although knowing Trump,
it was probably 34 counts

00:04:06.934 --> 00:04:09.133
of falsifying
the same business document

00:04:09.133 --> 00:04:11.167
over and over.
"What should we say

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:13.334
the $130K to Michael Cohen
is for?"

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:14.901
"A legal retainer.
No, wait.

00:04:14.901 --> 00:04:17.000
It was for
campaign advisory duties.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.334
Scratch that.
Say he sold me a jetski.

00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:20.667
Better still..."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.667 --> 00:04:22.834
"...it was a down payment
for a new orphanage.

00:04:22.834 --> 00:04:25.634
Hang on.
It was jetskis for orphans.

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:27.133
That's the one."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.300
34 counts.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:29.634
I mean, if you throw
in the other cases

00:04:29.634 --> 00:04:31.334
he's dealing with,
over the coup attempt

00:04:31.334 --> 00:04:32.801
and the classified documents
he stole,

00:04:32.801 --> 00:04:34.367
by the time we get
to the primaries next year,

00:04:34.367 --> 00:04:36.901
Trump could be facing like
a thousand criminal charges,

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.267
which would be very funny.

00:04:38.267 --> 00:04:40.467
We spent all this time
waiting for one criminal charge

00:04:40.467 --> 00:04:42.300
and ended up getting
a ton of them all at once.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.734
It's like when you turn
on a hose and nothing comes out,

00:04:44.734 --> 00:04:46.067
then you realize
you've been standing on it

00:04:46.067 --> 00:04:47.100
and you take your foot off

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.701
and you just get blasted
in the face.

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:50.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.033 --> 00:04:52.200
And, apparently,
Fox was not alone

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.367
in its surprise at the news.

00:04:53.367 --> 00:04:55.167
Even Trump himself
seemed caught off guard.

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:57.334
In fact, he was apparently
so unprepared,

00:04:57.334 --> 00:04:59.567
he didn't have a social-media
post ready to go,

00:04:59.567 --> 00:05:01.834
as evidenced by the fact
that his first comment

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:03.868
about the news had a typo

00:05:03.868 --> 00:05:05.834
in what I would call
a pretty important word.

00:05:05.834 --> 00:05:07.133
-Moments after the indictment,

00:05:07.133 --> 00:05:10.033
Trump went on a rant
on Truth Social, saying,

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:13.567
and I quote here,
"Thugs and radical left monsters

00:05:13.567 --> 00:05:17.534
had indicated the 45th president
of the United States."

00:05:17.534 --> 00:05:20.501
Yes, he meant indicted.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.501 --> 00:05:24.634
-Or he meant indicated because
he thinks they're the same.

00:05:24.634 --> 00:05:26.267
He thinks they just asked
the grand jury,

00:05:26.267 --> 00:05:29.100
"Can you indicate if you think
this man paid off a porn star?"

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.801
and they all do this.

00:05:30.801 --> 00:05:33.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.734 --> 00:05:37.434
Also, how did he not have
a pre-written social-media post

00:05:37.434 --> 00:05:38.901
ready to go
for this eventuality?

00:05:38.901 --> 00:05:40.300
This would be like
the British newspapers

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.701
not having an obituary ready
when the Queen died.

00:05:42.701 --> 00:05:44.400
"She's dead!
Oh [bleep]

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.200
Uh..."
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.801
"Uh, somebody google
what year she was born!

00:05:47.801 --> 00:05:48.934
Oh!"
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.934 --> 00:05:50.501
"Who were her parents?!"

00:05:50.501 --> 00:05:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:52.067 --> 00:05:53.901
"Is her first name 'Queen'?"

00:05:53.901 --> 00:05:55.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:55.767 --> 00:05:58.100
And yet, as shocked
as Trump and Fox seemed,

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:59.534
his allies in the GOP,

00:05:59.534 --> 00:06:01.968
and in particular his two
oddly shaped adult sons,

00:06:01.968 --> 00:06:04.267
seem especially taken aback.

00:06:04.267 --> 00:06:06.534
They took to right-wing media
in full-blown hysterics,

00:06:06.534 --> 00:06:09.267
raging against the indictments
to the point where it seemed

00:06:09.267 --> 00:06:11.067
like they were all about
to break down sobbing

00:06:11.067 --> 00:06:13.634
while also insisting
that Trump's enemies

00:06:13.634 --> 00:06:14.934
were trying to destroy America

00:06:14.934 --> 00:06:16.367
and the Trump
should essentially be allowed

00:06:16.367 --> 00:06:19.667
to commit whatever crimes
he wants without consequences.

00:06:19.667 --> 00:06:21.501
-They're trying
to smear the guy.

00:06:21.501 --> 00:06:24.601
They're trying to take cases
that nobody else would take

00:06:24.601 --> 00:06:25.968
and resurrect them.

00:06:25.968 --> 00:06:27.968
This is literally legal voodoo.

00:06:27.968 --> 00:06:29.667
-Let's be clear, folks.

00:06:29.667 --> 00:06:34.467
This is...
like, communist-level [bleep]

00:06:34.467 --> 00:06:42.033
This is stuff that would make
Mao, Stalin, Pol Pot,

00:06:42.033 --> 00:06:43.868
it would make them blush.

00:06:43.868 --> 00:06:47.033
-They see the weaponization
of politics

00:06:47.033 --> 00:06:48.567
and of the justice system.

00:06:48.567 --> 00:06:50.334
We've seen it with the FBI.
We've seen it with the DOJ.

00:06:50.334 --> 00:06:53.000
We've seen it
time and time again.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.968
At some point,
the guy deserves a pass.

00:06:54.968 --> 00:06:57.801
-"At some point"?
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.801 --> 00:07:00.334
The guy's entire life
has been a pass!

00:07:00.334 --> 00:07:01.501
It's like --
[ Laughter ]

00:07:01.501 --> 00:07:03.167
It's like Trump
has an Olive Garden

00:07:03.167 --> 00:07:05.133
Never Ending Pasta Pass
but for crime.

00:07:05.133 --> 00:07:06.167
[ Laughter ]

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:07.534
He was accused
of racial discrimination

00:07:07.534 --> 00:07:08.934
and violating
the Fair Housing Act

00:07:08.934 --> 00:07:10.434
50 years ago.
He spent years engaged

00:07:10.434 --> 00:07:11.901
in serial tax fraud
with the millions

00:07:11.901 --> 00:07:12.901
he inherited from his father.

00:07:12.901 --> 00:07:14.667
He bragged about
sexual assault on a bus,

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.000
he colluded
with one foreign country,

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.367
tried to extort
another foreign country

00:07:17.367 --> 00:07:18.534
to help him cheat
in an election,

00:07:18.534 --> 00:07:21.067
and he stared
at a [bleep] eclipse.

00:07:21.067 --> 00:07:22.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.934
And got away with it!
Your whole life,

00:07:23.934 --> 00:07:26.434
people tell you not to stare
at an eclipse.

00:07:26.434 --> 00:07:29.334
This dude does it, he's fine.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:32.868
Just fine. Walking around,
both eyes working great.

00:07:32.868 --> 00:07:35.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.067 --> 00:07:36.634
Also, is it just me
or has Don Jr.

00:07:36.634 --> 00:07:37.901
been watching "Succession"?

00:07:37.901 --> 00:07:40.567
Because he has major
Kendall Roy energy in that clip.

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:41.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.868 --> 00:07:44.434
"I want this party to be
totally [bleep] revolutionary,

00:07:44.434 --> 00:07:45.868
like communist type [bleep].

00:07:45.868 --> 00:07:48.033
Let's get, like,
a Stalin impersonator

00:07:48.033 --> 00:07:50.167
and maybe some [bleep] ketamine
or some [bleep]."

00:07:50.167 --> 00:07:51.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:51.767 --> 00:07:53.801
"Blow [bleep] lines
with Pol Pot."

00:07:53.801 --> 00:07:56.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:56.234 --> 00:07:57.400
Although Lindsey Graham
freaking out

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.133
is really my personal
favorite example,

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:01.033
given that he once
ferociously criticized Trump.

00:08:01.033 --> 00:08:03.167
After the coup,
famously said, "Count me out."

00:08:03.167 --> 00:08:05.734
Now Lindsey has flip-flopped
so radically once again,

00:08:05.734 --> 00:08:08.601
he's calling the charges voodoo
and saying stuff like this

00:08:08.601 --> 00:08:10.701
about how many counts
there supposedly are.

00:08:10.701 --> 00:08:13.534
-If you've got a pile of crap
and you chop it up 34 times,

00:08:13.534 --> 00:08:14.868
it's still a pile of crap.

00:08:14.868 --> 00:08:16.367
It's "duplishus" charging.

00:08:16.367 --> 00:08:19.300
-He's so enraged, he can't
even say the word "duplicitous."

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.534
He sounds like he's in
an episode of "Love is Blind,"

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:23.868
where they bring everyone back
and get 'em wasted.

00:08:23.868 --> 00:08:25.267
"Irene is trying
to get with Paul.

00:08:25.267 --> 00:08:28.601
She's being so duplishus."

00:08:28.601 --> 00:08:30.634
Lindsay hasn't been this mad
since his memaw

00:08:30.634 --> 00:08:32.434
made him go out back
and clean the barn.

00:08:32.434 --> 00:08:34.567
[As Graham] "I don't care
if they're just chickens, Memaw.

00:08:34.567 --> 00:08:37.000
If you chop up a pile of crap
34 times,

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.200
it's still a pile of crap!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.701
I'm not cleaning up
this coop again

00:08:40.701 --> 00:08:42.334
until you promise
to stop feeding

00:08:42.334 --> 00:08:45.534
these chickens
your spicy jambalaya!

00:08:45.534 --> 00:08:47.667
Chickens ain't
supposed to eat shrimp, Memaw!

00:08:47.667 --> 00:08:49.434
It's unnatural!"

00:08:49.434 --> 00:08:53.067
[ Laughter ]

00:08:53.067 --> 00:08:54.467
It's just Monday.

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:57.000
It's just a monday, and
we're all having fun together.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.667
Also, let's make something
very clear.

00:08:58.667 --> 00:09:00.501
None of us, not me,
not Lindsey Graham,

00:09:00.501 --> 00:09:02.133
have seen
the charging document yet.

00:09:02.133 --> 00:09:04.601
We likely won't get that
until the arraignment tomorrow.

00:09:04.601 --> 00:09:06.100
So we don't know
the exact charges yet.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.701
But that hasn't stopped Trump's
allies from slamming them.

00:09:08.701 --> 00:09:11.601
In yet another Fox appearance,
Eric Trump told a bizarre story

00:09:11.601 --> 00:09:14.868
where he claimed he was
on a plane when the news broke

00:09:14.868 --> 00:09:17.000
and that everyone around him
was on his side.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.801
-I was on a plane.
I was on a commercial flight

00:09:18.801 --> 00:09:20.501
when this whole
indictment broke.

00:09:20.501 --> 00:09:22.934
People were coming up to me,
giving me hugs.

00:09:22.934 --> 00:09:24.701
-Were they passengers
giving you hugs

00:09:24.701 --> 00:09:27.901
or air marshals
tackling you to the ground?

00:09:27.901 --> 00:09:29.934
"I was on a plane.
I got the news.

00:09:29.934 --> 00:09:31.234
I tried to get in the cockpit

00:09:31.234 --> 00:09:33.000
so I could get it to Mar-a-Lago
and see my daddy.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.300
And then the people
were so great.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.601
They were hugging me
and giving me

00:09:35.601 --> 00:09:37.534
these wonderful
friendship bracelets."

00:09:37.534 --> 00:09:39.601
Although, that was not
the weirdest thing

00:09:39.601 --> 00:09:40.934
Eric Trump said on Fox.

00:09:40.934 --> 00:09:42.667
He also tried to insist
that the Manhattan D.A.

00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:45.501
was targeting his father
at the expense of other crimes,

00:09:45.501 --> 00:09:48.801
although his story about the
supposed crimes kept changing.

00:09:48.801 --> 00:09:50.501
-This is a city -- I've spent
a lot of time in New York --

00:09:50.501 --> 00:09:52.067
that is falling apart.

00:09:52.067 --> 00:09:54.300
I went into literally CVS
the other day,

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.767
and you can't buy Tylenol

00:09:55.767 --> 00:09:58.801
because it's locked
behind these glass counters

00:09:58.801 --> 00:10:01.067
because there's so much theft
and there's so much looting.

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:03.133
I went into Duane Reade
the other day,

00:10:03.133 --> 00:10:06.434
and literally you can't buy
Advil in Duane Reade

00:10:06.434 --> 00:10:08.701
without having somebody
come up with a key and unlock,

00:10:08.701 --> 00:10:10.767
you know, those little
plastic things that you pick up

00:10:10.767 --> 00:10:13.067
because there's so much looting
in the city.

00:10:13.067 --> 00:10:15.334
-Usually when people go to
that many different pharmacies,

00:10:15.334 --> 00:10:16.934
their name is Jesse Pinkman.

00:10:16.934 --> 00:10:20.834
"Bad news, Mr. White!
The Sudafed is all locked up!"

00:10:22.033 --> 00:10:24.033
Is it Tylenol at CVS
or Advil at Duane Reade?

00:10:24.033 --> 00:10:25.901
Just pick a fake story
and stick with it.

00:10:25.901 --> 00:10:27.567
"I went to CVS to buy Tylenol.

00:10:27.567 --> 00:10:29.167
Then I went to Duane Reade
to buy Advil.

00:10:29.167 --> 00:10:30.634
Then I went to Rite Aid
to buy Motrin.

00:10:30.634 --> 00:10:32.634
And then I went to a Sunoco
to buy a Monster Energy drink.

00:10:32.634 --> 00:10:34.167
And then I combined them all
and chugged it

00:10:34.167 --> 00:10:36.601
so I could stay up for 72 hours
straight on Fox News.

00:10:36.601 --> 00:10:39.567
That's why I sound like this!

00:10:39.567 --> 00:10:42.067
Everybody in every one of
those places gave me a hug!"

00:10:44.501 --> 00:10:46.534
But I also want
to address this notion

00:10:46.534 --> 00:10:48.701
that indicting
a former president

00:10:48.701 --> 00:10:51.801
is somehow communism
or antithetical to democracy --

00:10:51.801 --> 00:10:54.067
another ridiculous
talking point Trump's goons

00:10:54.067 --> 00:10:56.100
have been regurgitating
on Fox News the last few days.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.834
In fact,
even the rest of the media

00:10:57.834 --> 00:10:59.300
has been framing this story

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.501
as an unprecedented test
for American democracy.

00:11:01.501 --> 00:11:04.467
CNN said, "There is nothing
in American history

00:11:04.467 --> 00:11:07.167
that approaches the tumult of
the charging and possible trial

00:11:07.167 --> 00:11:08.767
and conviction
of a former president."

00:11:08.767 --> 00:11:11.133
Okay, first of all,
it's not "a former president."

00:11:11.133 --> 00:11:13.834
It's this one.
You got to stop talking about

00:11:13.834 --> 00:11:16.267
how a former president
being arrested is this crazy

00:11:16.267 --> 00:11:18.467
and unprecedented act
without mentioning

00:11:18.467 --> 00:11:21.200
that the guy was crazy
and unprecedented.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.667
Until now, we mostly elected
career politicians.

00:11:23.667 --> 00:11:25.767
And then for some reason,
we flipped out

00:11:25.767 --> 00:11:27.267
and went for brain-damaged
casino greeter.

00:11:27.267 --> 00:11:29.934
You don't get to be surprised
he turns up shady.

00:11:29.934 --> 00:11:31.334
You know what I mean?

00:11:31.334 --> 00:11:33.868
It's not like some
Illinois D.A. in 1848

00:11:33.868 --> 00:11:35.501
was weighing
whether or not to charge

00:11:35.501 --> 00:11:38.200
Abraham Lincoln for paying off
adult daguerreotype model

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.534
Breezy Candles.

00:11:39.534 --> 00:11:41.567
And, yes, it may be true

00:11:41.567 --> 00:11:43.300
that indicting
a former president

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.968
is a first
in American history,

00:11:44.968 --> 00:11:46.868
but it's not a first
for functioning democracies.

00:11:46.868 --> 00:11:48.300
In fact, it's the opposite.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.901
Healthy democracies should be
capable of holding their leaders

00:11:50.901 --> 00:11:52.467
accountable
for breaking the law.

00:11:52.467 --> 00:11:54.033
And it's happened
many other times

00:11:54.033 --> 00:11:55.934
in other functioning democracies
around the world.

00:11:55.934 --> 00:11:59.200
Two former French presidents,
several South Korean presidents,

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.734
and two former presidents
of Taiwan

00:12:00.734 --> 00:12:02.334
have all been convicted
in recent years

00:12:02.334 --> 00:12:03.834
on charges
ranging from corruption

00:12:03.834 --> 00:12:06.200
to bribery to embezzlement,
and even here in the U.S.,

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.801
politicians
who aren't presidents

00:12:07.801 --> 00:12:09.133
get indicted routinely.

00:12:09.133 --> 00:12:11.200
Let me offer as evidence
the entire state of New Jersey,

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:15.100
where, by law, you're not
allowed to run for office

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:18.501
until they pre-fit you
for an ankle monitor.

00:12:18.501 --> 00:12:20.100
"We're not saying
you did anything.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:23.434
We're just saying
you're probably gonna."

00:12:23.434 --> 00:12:26.100
12 United States senators have
been indicted in our history.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.501
Nixon's vice president
was charged with a felony.

00:12:28.501 --> 00:12:30.567
And even in just one state,
Illinois,

00:12:30.567 --> 00:12:33.434
four of the last ten governors
have spent time in prison,

00:12:33.434 --> 00:12:35.234
including Rod Blagojevich,
who, of course,

00:12:35.234 --> 00:12:36.767
was on Donald Trump's
reality show,

00:12:36.767 --> 00:12:38.667
despite the fact
that Trump almost certainly

00:12:38.667 --> 00:12:39.868
could not say his last name.

00:12:39.868 --> 00:12:42.467
If Trump tried to say
Blagojevich's last name,

00:12:42.467 --> 00:12:43.801
he'd probably end up
calling him Rod...

00:12:43.801 --> 00:12:45.601
-Duplishus.

00:12:45.601 --> 00:12:46.968
[ Laughter ]

00:12:46.968 --> 00:12:49.200
-And if Trump World and Fox News
were caught off guard

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.033
by the indictment,
then I can only imagine

00:12:51.033 --> 00:12:52.901
how unprepared they're
gonna be for the spectacle

00:12:52.901 --> 00:12:54.100
we're about to witness tomorrow.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.534
For the first time
in American history,

00:12:55.534 --> 00:12:57.367
we're gonna see a former
president surrender himself

00:12:57.367 --> 00:12:58.667
at a courthouse for booking.

00:12:58.667 --> 00:13:00.234
-The Secret Service
is preparing

00:13:00.234 --> 00:13:02.734
to bring the former president

00:13:02.734 --> 00:13:06.067
to his court appearance
on Tuesday in Manhattan.

00:13:06.067 --> 00:13:08.667
This is something
that they've been talking with

00:13:08.667 --> 00:13:11.868
the New York Police Department,
the court security staff.

00:13:11.868 --> 00:13:14.567
It's something they spent
days and days working out.

00:13:14.567 --> 00:13:17.334
-People familiar
with this arraignment

00:13:17.334 --> 00:13:18.634
are saying that they expect

00:13:18.634 --> 00:13:21.534
it will be handled
like a regular arraignment.

00:13:21.534 --> 00:13:24.133
He will still come in.
He will still be processed.

00:13:24.133 --> 00:13:25.701
He will still be fingerprinted.

00:13:25.701 --> 00:13:27.300
And he will go before this judge

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:30.033
and be asked to enter a plea
in this case.

00:13:30.033 --> 00:13:32.434
-We understand
that he will get a mugshot,

00:13:32.434 --> 00:13:34.501
he will get fingerprinted.

00:13:34.501 --> 00:13:36.601
Whether he'll be
handcuffed, though,

00:13:36.601 --> 00:13:38.868
that remains an open question.

00:13:38.868 --> 00:13:40.267
-I wouldn't put cuffs on him

00:13:40.267 --> 00:13:42.167
because he would definitely
try to wriggle his way out.

00:13:42.167 --> 00:13:45.601
I'm pretty sure that's what he's
been practicing at his rallies

00:13:45.601 --> 00:13:48.033
whenever they play "YMCA."

00:13:48.033 --> 00:13:51.000
I mean, here we've been
making fun of the way he dances,

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.934
and he's just gonna be
boogieing away from the cops.

00:13:53.934 --> 00:13:55.400
But it'll be especially
fascinating to see

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.734
how Trump handles his mugshot.
Trump's allies on Fox News

00:13:57.734 --> 00:13:59.834
seem to think the mugshot
will actually help Trump.

00:13:59.834 --> 00:14:02.000
And this just gives you
an idea of how desperate

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.667
they are to look
for an upside here.

00:14:03.667 --> 00:14:06.033
Fox pundits
have actually been on air

00:14:06.033 --> 00:14:08.467
claiming that Trump's mugshot
will make him look cool.

00:14:08.467 --> 00:14:11.334
-This is a horrible night
for our republic

00:14:11.334 --> 00:14:14.033
but politically a great night
for Donald Trump,

00:14:14.033 --> 00:14:15.801
in that -- It just is.

00:14:15.801 --> 00:14:17.467
[ Applause ]

00:14:17.467 --> 00:14:19.334
Because -- No, no.

00:14:19.334 --> 00:14:20.868
Because they're gonna --

00:14:20.868 --> 00:14:24.067
You remember the mugshots
of Elvis and Frank Sinatra

00:14:24.067 --> 00:14:27.167
and Johnny Cash and Jimi Hendrix
and Mick Jagger

00:14:27.167 --> 00:14:30.300
turned them into even
bigger icons than they were?

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.567
If there's a mugshot
of Donald Trump,

00:14:32.567 --> 00:14:36.334
it'll be in dorm rooms and
on T-shirts, making him a hero.

00:14:36.334 --> 00:14:38.567
-Only thing --
Every person you mentioned...

00:14:38.567 --> 00:14:41.400
a kick-ass musician.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.434
Being a kick-ass musician
pairs well with crime.

00:14:44.434 --> 00:14:45.868
Other jobs, less so.

00:14:45.868 --> 00:14:48.300
I also think
the Johnny Cash mugshot is cool,

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:52.367
but if my dentist had one
of himself in his office,

00:14:52.367 --> 00:14:55.067
I wouldn't like that.

00:14:55.067 --> 00:14:57.200
And just a word of warning
to any college students.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.367
If you put a poster of
Trump's mugshot on your wall,

00:14:59.367 --> 00:15:01.367
congratulations on
never getting laid again.

00:15:01.367 --> 00:15:03.801
Not -- Not because
of your politics,

00:15:03.801 --> 00:15:05.968
but because nothing
would be more of a mood killer

00:15:05.968 --> 00:15:08.300
than seeing Donald Trump's
sweaty grimace

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.000
while you're trying to get down

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.434
with someone you met
at a frat party.

00:15:11.434 --> 00:15:13.701
I mean, imagine sneaking
into someone's pitch-black

00:15:13.701 --> 00:15:15.701
dorm room at 3:00 a.m.
for a hookup,

00:15:15.701 --> 00:15:17.901
and then they flick
on a lava lamp and you see this.

00:15:17.901 --> 00:15:20.667
You'd be like, "Oh!

00:15:20.667 --> 00:15:22.834
Oh, God. Ple--
Turn the light off, please!"

00:15:22.834 --> 00:15:24.901
"Actually, if you don't mind,
I'd like to watch."

00:15:24.901 --> 00:15:28.067
"Your po-- Your poster talks?!"

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:32.434
Trump and his allies
have been dismissing this case

00:15:32.434 --> 00:15:33.834
as a bookkeeping charge

00:15:33.834 --> 00:15:35.467
when in reality
it's so much more.

00:15:35.467 --> 00:15:37.100
No one cares
about the affair itself,

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:40.033
and even the hush money is not
a crime if done correctly.

00:15:40.033 --> 00:15:42.267
But Trump
secretly funneled money

00:15:42.267 --> 00:15:44.834
through a fixer to silence
an adult-film actress

00:15:44.834 --> 00:15:47.400
weeks before a presidential
election, and he lied about it.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.701
He defrauded voters to become

00:15:48.701 --> 00:15:50.534
the most powerful person
in the world.

00:15:50.534 --> 00:15:54.133
And in a functioning democracy,
it's actually normal and healthy

00:15:54.133 --> 00:15:56.067
to hold a president
accountable for that,

00:15:56.067 --> 00:15:58.734
even if this is the first time
we've done it here in America.

00:15:58.734 --> 00:16:00.334
And, look,
as I mentioned before,

00:16:00.334 --> 00:16:02.734
I'm not saying this is all
worth it, because it wasn't,

00:16:02.734 --> 00:16:05.501
although I will say when news of
Trump's indictment broke --

00:16:05.501 --> 00:16:06.767
and this is a true story...

00:16:06.767 --> 00:16:09.067
-People were coming up to me
giving me hugs.

00:16:09.067 --> 00:16:11.300
-This has been "A Closer Look."

